| `WorkerMetrics` | `worker_id`, `cpu_percent`, `memory_percent`, `memory_used_mb`, `memory_total_mb`, `disk_*`, `rx/tx_bytes_per_sec`, `load_avg_1m`, `active_jobs`, `timestamp` |
