**RPC Service: `SchedulerService`**
```
service SchedulerService {
  rpc RegisterWorker(RegisterWorkerRequest) returns (RegisterWorkerReply);
  rpc SubmitJob(SubmitJobRequest) returns (SubmitJobReply);
  rpc GetJobStatus(GetJobStatusRequest) returns (GetJobStatusReply);
  rpc GetJob(GetJobRequest) returns (GetJobResponse);
  rpc RegisterClient(RegisterClientRequest) returns (RegisterClientResponse);
  rpc ReportJobResult(ReportJobResultRequest) returns (ReportJobResultReply);
  rpc ConfirmJobReceived(ConfirmJobReceivedRequest) returns (ConfirmJobReceivedResponse);
  rpc ReportJobStarted(ReportJobStartedRequest) returns (ReportJobStartedResponse);
  rpc ReportWorkerMetrics(WorkerMetrics) returns (ReportWorkerMetricsResponse);
  rpc ReportJobEbpfMetrics(ReportJobEbpfMetricsRequest) returns (ReportJobEbpfMetricsResponse);
  rpc GetJobTimeseries(GetJobTimeseriesRequest) returns (GetJobTimeseriesResponse);
}
```

---

### Summary of Design Patterns Used

| Pattern | Location |
|---|---|
| **Strategy** | `JobSelector` hierarchy (FCFS, SJF, Adaptive) & `JobExecutor` hierarchy (CPU, MEM, IO, Mixed) |
| **Abstract Factory / Factory Method** | `JobSelectorRegistry` (with `make_selector<T>()` template), `ExecutorRegistry` (with lambda factories) |
| **Interface Segregation** | `ISchedulerDatabase` (narrow interface for strategies, separate from full `SchedulerDatabase`) |
| **Observer (Callback)** | `JobOrchestrator::on_completed` -- `std::function` callback invoked on job completion |
| **RAII** | `JobOrchestrator` (threads joined in destructor, cgroups cleaned up), `EbpfMonitor` (bpf objects detached) |
| **Template Method** | `SJFSelector` fallback to `FCFSSelector` logic internally |
| **Multiple Inheritance** | `SchedulerDatabase : public Database, public ISchedulerDatabase` |
| **Compile-time Policy Selection** | `SchedulerDb` typedef switching between SQLite and PostgreSQL via `USE_PG` macro |
| **Thread-safe Accumulator (Buffer)** | `EbpfMetricStore` with mutex-protected `add_snapshot` / `drain` |

### Inheritance Hierarchy Diagram

```
Database (shared/database.h)                        ISchedulerDatabase (scheduler/idb.hpp)
    |                                                       |
    +--- SchedulerDatabase (scheduler/scheduler_db.h) ------+  (multiple inheritance)
    |
    +--- WorkerDatabase (worker/worker_db.hpp)

JobSelector (scheduler/job_selector.hpp)              JobExecutor (worker/executors/job_executor.hpp)
    |                                                       |
    +--- FCFSSelector                                       +--- StressCpuExecutor
    +--- SJFSelector                                        +--- StressMemExecutor
    +--- AdaptiveSelector                                   +--- StressIOExecutor
                                                            +--- MixedLoadExecutor

SchedulerServiceImpl : djs::SchedulerService::Service (gRPC generated base)
    - owns SchedulerDb (database)
    - owns unique_ptr<JobSelector> (strategy)

WorkerClient
    - owns WorkerDatabase
    - owns djs::SchedulerService::Stub (gRPC client stub)

JobOrchestrator
    - uses EbpfMetricStore* (non-owning pointer)
    - manages JobHandle per active job (fork/exec lifecycle)
```
